nge of climate and soil types. Mean soil BNE rate in croplands was estimated at 0.93 kg N ha-1 yr-1 and varied among the climatic zones, where the highest rate was in the north subtropical zone (1.66 kg N ha-1 yr-1) and the lowest in the cold temperate zone (0.53 kg N ha-1 yr-1). We estimated total national BNE for China based on the BNE rates for the different climatic zones and found it to be 129 Gg N yr-1; this estimate was higher than the estimate of 114 Gg N yr-1 derived from using only a single national average BNE rate. Stepwise multiple regression modelling of soil BNE rate (\n######################\nOutput:'}
